{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_12225490","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12225490","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:6:1222549001:0":{"text":"はぁ……はぁ……！","source_cn":"呼……呼……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B09FC1F4A933E27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1222549002:0":{"text":"誇り高き騎士が、二度も撤退するなんて……！","source_cn":"满满光荣的骑士生涯中又出现了一次大撤退……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0FE204C3AE7BCE8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1222549003:0":{"text":"仕方ねぇだろ。フーキンの大砲ですら歯が立たなかったんだぜ？","source_cn":"没办法，你们也看见了，连呼金的炮都没法对那个野兽造成威胁！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29BD58C19C5D9054","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1222549004:0":{"text":"バカな……ありえない！ワシの自慢の子どもたちが……イモータル号での決戦の経験を生かし、大型の敵や水生生物を想定して改良した最新式だぞ！","source_cn":"不可能……这不可能！那些孩子是我的得意之作，是在不死号...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA773C761B4EF19F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1222549005:0":{"text":"弾道は正確だったし、火薬の威力も問題なかった。負ける理由なんてなかったはずだ！","source_cn":"弹道精确无误……火药爆炸威力得当……他们没有道理失败！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xACFAB5B2BDAFB2BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":